MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01_001: I am relieved to find Megaira largely unchanged.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01_002: I ought to spend some time greeting the officials\nhere as well.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01_003: Let us hope no further incidents bar your path to\ninheriting the throne from King Sergio.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01_004: I fear I shall not know rest until your coronation day,\nhmhmhm.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_Bon_m01: <BLN>This is a relief.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01_001: I heard King Sergio has been sick for a while.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01_002: Lucky for us that he kept it together until you came\nof age, boss.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01_003: Gahaha! What am I saying? I should look on the\nbright side.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01_004: By the way, the kids have been begging me to tell\n'em some good war stories.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01_005: I'm gonna let 'em know how great you were, boss!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_Tob_m01: <BLN>Lucky we made it in time.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01_001: King Sergio has been very excited for you to return,\nYour Highness.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01_002: Though I myself have been more troubled by Prince\nDyan's strange behavior.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01_003: But once the throne is yours, I suspect we'll see less\nof that from him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01_004: You, though! I can't believe what strides you've made\nin a few short years.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_Kon_m01: <BLN>You've come into your own.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Hoo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Hoo_m01_001: Princess Theodora. Welcome home to Megaira.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Hoo_m01_002: Your exploits at Fort Zanbar have only added to\nyour legend.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_Hoo_m01: <BLN>Welcome home.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B01_m01_001: Princess Theodora! It doesn't have to be today, but\nI'd be honored if you'd bless my daughter.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B01_m01_002: That way, the child will grow up strong and true,\njust like Your Highness!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B01_m01: <BLN>Princess Theodora!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B02_m01_001: Welcome back, Princess Theodora. Thank you for\nfighting for us at Fort Zanbar.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B02_m01_002: Today, all of Megaira will feast in honor of your\nreturn and imminent coronation!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B02_m01_003: The revels will last until dawn, so I hope you'll make\nan appearance, Your Highness.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B02_m01: <BLN>Today we feast!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B03_m01_001: We won't be able to speak so casually once you're\nqueen, I suppose.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B03_m01_002: It's a good thing for the kingdom, but a bit sad for\nthe common folk like me.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B03_m01_003: But these things happen. I hope you'll at least spend\ntime with us tonight until the banquet ends!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B03_m01: <BLN>Let's make the most of tonight.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B04_m01_001: Princess Theodora! I hope you're excited for\ntonight's feast.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B04_m01_002: I know the rest of us are. We can't wait to celebrate\nyou, Your Highness.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B04_m01: <BLN>It'll be a lively affair!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B05_m01_001: Lately, there have been more sightings of Har Hali\nwarriors here and there.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B05_m01_002: There's no knowing what those people are thinking.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B05_m01_003: Granted, all the forest peoples are children of\nDamascar, just as we are.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B05_m01_004: But the Har Hali are strange even among their\nnumber. I'd steer clear if I were you.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B05_m01: <BLN>Those recent sightings...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B06_m01_001: I'm glad you're home, Theodora!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B06_m01: <BLN>You're back!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B07_m01_001: Is everything gonna be OK now that you're back\nfrom Fort Zanbar?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B07_m01_002: The Mosa are super scary, huh? We'd be in trouble\nwithout you around.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B07_m01: <BLN>Uh-oh...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B08_m01_001: Thank you for your service during your long tour of\nduty at Fort Zanbar.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B08_m01_002: The Mosa were unrelenting, but you stood firm\nagainst them every time.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B08_m01_003: Tales of Your Highness's feats of valor as the Iron\nBastion reached us all the way here at Megaira.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B08_m01: <BLN>Thank you for your service.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B09_m01_001: Welcome back, Princess Theodora! Everything is\ngoing well on the home front.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B09_m01_002: So well that they're throwing a grand feast in your\nhonor tonight.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B09_m01: <BLN>Can't wait for the feast.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B010_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B010_m01_001: Your father hasn't made any public appearances in\nthe last year.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B010_m01_002: That may be why speculation about the king's health\nis running rampant in the city.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B010_m01_003: The chancellor is taking careful note in case anyone\nis spreading these rumors deliberately.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B010_m01: <BLN>Such ugly rumors...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B011_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B011_m01_001: It's been nearly two years now since King Sergio first\nfell ill.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B011_m01_002: A lot of Saraminians are uneasy about the future.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B011_m01_003: I think your coronation will do a lot to put their\nminds to rest, Your Highness.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B011_m01: <BLN>Everyone will feel better.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B012_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B012_m01_001: That Prince Dyan spends his days lazing around the\nroyal palace.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B012_m01_002: I know you'll be our next monarch, Your Highness,\nbut his attitude still doesn't sit well with me.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B012_m01_003: I'd feel better if there weren't some within Saramis\nwho'd prefer he take the throne instead.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B012_m01: <BLN>What is he thinking?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B013_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B013_m01_001: Did I see Commander Huver of the Cybeleia\nregiment somewhere around here?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B013_m01_002: I realize this is an important ceremony for the future\nof our kingdom.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B013_m01_003: But whose bright idea was it to recall the\ncommanders from their posts protecting us?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B013_m01: <BLN>I'm not sure about this...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B014_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B014_m01_001: The whole city of Megaira is holding a feast in honor\nof you taking the throne.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_B014_m01_002: We're all hoping you'll regale us with a story or two.\nI hope you won't be too busy to indulge us.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c01_B014_m01: <BLN>Everyone hopes to see you.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Seo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Seo_m01_001: Is it time to take my leave here and go to greet\nmy father?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Seo_m01_002: <ICA>Greet him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c01_Seo_m01_003: <ICB>Wait.